text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro {
    "{RIVAL}: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
    "I was looking forward to seeing\n"
    "you, {PLAYER}.\p"
    "My rival should be strong to keep\n"
    "me sharp.\p"
    "While working on my POKéDEX, I\n"
    "looked all over for POKéMON.\p"
    "Not only that, I assembled teams\n"
    "that would beat any POKéMON type.\p"
    "And now…\p"
    "I'm the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    "{PLAYER}!\n"
    "Do you know what that means?\p"
    "I'll tell you.\p"
    "I am the most powerful TRAINER in\n"
    "the world!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro {
    "{RIVAL}: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
    "You came back, {PLAYER}!\n"
    "Hahah, that is so great!\p"
    "My rival should be strong to keep\n"
    "me sharp.\p"
    "While working on my POKéDEX, I\n"
    "looked all over for POKéMON.\p"
    "Not only that, I assembled teams\n"
    "that would beat any POKéMON type.\p"
    "And now…\p"
    "I'm the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    "{PLAYER}!\n"
    "Do you know what that means?\p"
    "I'll tell you.\p"
    "I am the most powerful TRAINER in\n"
    "the world!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat {
    "NO!\n"
    "That can't be!\l"
    "You beat me at my best!\p"
    "After all that work to become\n"
    "the LEAGUE CHAMP?\p"
    "My reign is over already?\n"
    "It's not fair!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory {
    "はーはッ！\n"
    "かった！　かった！　かった！\p"
    "{PLAYER}に　まける　ような\n"
    "おれさま　では　なーい！\p"
    "ま！　ポケモンの\n"
    "てんさい　{RIVAL}さま　あいてに\l"
    "ここまで　よく　がんばった！\p"
    "ほめて　つかわす！\n"
    "はーッ！　はーはッはッ！$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle {
    "Why?\n"
    "Why did I lose?\p"
    "I never made any mistakes raising\n"
    "my POKéMON…\p"
    "Darn it! You're the new POKéMON\n"
    "LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    "Although I don't like to admit it…$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer {
    "OAK: {PLAYER}!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations {
    "OAK: So, you've won!\n"
    "Sincerely, congratulations!\p"
    "You're the new POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
    "CHAMPION!\p"
    "You've grown up so much since you\n"
    "first left with {STR_VAR_1} to work\l"
    "on the POKéDEX.\p"
    "{PLAYER}, you have come of age!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival {
    "OAK: {RIVAL}…\n"
    "I'm disappointed in you.\p"
    "I came when I heard you'd beaten\n"
    "the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    "But, when I got here, you had\n"
    "already lost!\p"
    "{RIVAL}, do you understand why\n"
    "you lost?\p"
    "You have forgotten to treat your\n"
    "POKéMON with love and trust.\p"
    "Without them, you will never\n"
    "become a CHAMP again!$"
}

text PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe {
    "OAK: {PLAYER}.\p"
    "You understand that your victory\n"
    "was not just your own doing.\p"
    "The bond you share with your\n"
    "POKéMON is marvelous.\p"
    "{PLAYER}!\n"
    "Come with me!$"
}
